"PLST","SLD"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/8f9db31d598a6b45","cardmarket":"https://mtgjson.com/links/815107b3da7867ce","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/eb8346df76b47812"},"rarity":"rare","rulings":[{"date":"2022-06-10","text":"Archivist of Oghma's triggered ability won't be put onto the stack until after the spell or ability causing the opponent to search their library finishes resolving. Notably, if that spell or ability causes any other abilities to trigger (for example, if the opponent searched for a card and put it onto the battlefield), those abilities and Archivist of Oghma's triggered ability will go on the stack at the same time. The active player puts all their abilities on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order does the same. The last ability put onto the stack this way resolves first, and so on."},{"date":"2022-06-10","text":"Archivist of Oghma's triggered ability won't trigger if you search an opponent's library or an opponent searches another player's library."}],"securityStamp":"oval","setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"7a0287e9-a515-5750-92ac-337e60e2bd30"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":["Halfling","Cleric"],"supertypes":[],"text":"Flash\nWhenever an opponent searches their library, you gain 1 life and draw a card.","toughness":"2","type":"Creature — Halfling Cleric","types":["Creature"],"uuid":"863594b9-9ca3-5f35-a486-3e79a10eb425"},{"artist":"Christine Choi","artistIds":["b8266529-1ffe-41e7-9969-fcf39f61426b"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["W"],"colors":["W"],"convertedManaCost":4.0,"edhrecRank":2579,"edhrecSaltiness":0.47,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"flavorText":"\"The walls of Argive were built by a peaceful dynastic union that has guarded us against war for fifteen centuries. The lesson is clear.\"","foreignData":[],"frameEffects":["legendary"],"frameVersion":"2015","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"278147","cardsphereId":"104645","deckboxId":"80049","mcmId":"718681","mtgjsonV4Id":"a8d69086-0f08-5d72-8d67-069ba9465d50","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"2234006b-d369-498a-b652-c96b32a4e823","scryfallIllustrationId":"ac016122-3403-4614-9e66-0c342a198131","scryfallOracleId":"69aa6809-5468-413a-94c9-562e6de93957","tcgplayerProductId":"498559"},"isReprint":true,"keywords":["Vigilance"],"language":"English","layout":"normal","leadershipSkills":{"brawl":false,"commander":true,"oathbreaker":false,"pauper_commander":true,"predh":false},"legalities":{"brawl":"Legal","commander":"Legal","competitivebrawl":"Legal","duel":"Legal","gladiator":"Legal","historic":"Legal","legacy":"Legal","modern":"Legal","oathbreaker":"Legal","pioneer":"Legal","timeless":"Legal","vintage":"Legal"},"manaCost":"{2}{W}{W}","manaValue":4.0,"name":"Baird, Steward of Argive","number":"DOM-4","originalReleaseDate":"2023-06-23","power":"2","printings":["BLC","CMM","DOM","PDOM","PLST"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/908228b9fb0f0525","cardmarket":"https://mtgjson.com/links/ec77d5c70d4d92af","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/f7471ddba49ceff0"},"rarity":"uncommon","rulings":[{"date":"2018-04-27","text":"In a Two-Headed Giant game, creatures can attack your teammate and planeswalkers your teammate controls without requiring a mana payment. This is a change from previous rules."},{"date":"2023-07-28","text":"If you control Baird, your opponents can choose not to pay to attack with a creature that attacks \"if able.\" If there's no other player, planeswalker, or battle to attack, that creature simply doesn't attack."}