ceases to exist and won’t return to the battlefield."},{"date":"2016-06-08","text":"If the exiled card is an Aura, that card’s owner chooses what it will enchant as it comes back onto the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything (so it could be attached to a permanent with shroud, for example), but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains exiled."},{"date":"2016-06-08","text":"The exiled card will return to the battlefield at the beginning of the next end step even if Glimmerpoint Stag is no longer on the battlefield at that time."}],"setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"bcfb9e9e-e759-506f-8e4e-701413a5e788"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":["Elk"],"supertypes":[],"text":"Vigilance\nWhen this creature enters, exile another target permanent. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.","toughness":"3","type":"Creature — Elk","types":["Creature"],"uuid":"c8a97dd4-8689-5be8-8d25-4961ab2be87f","watermark":"mirran"},{"artist":"Adam Rex","artistIds":["445bd2fb-4a70-4599-87a4-83cf5979fc56"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["W"],"colors":["W"],"convertedManaCost":5.0,"edhrecRank":18518,"edhrecSaltiness":0.17,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"2003","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"237923","cardsphereId":"71567","deckboxId":"53266","mcmId":"497780","mtgjsonV4Id":"621569f8-02ac-5aa3-a05e-34c865e38b28","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfa