estral Blade will be attached to the Soldier before the game checks to see if it has toughness 0 or less. For example, if Illness in the Ranks (\"Creature tokens get -1/-1\") is on the battlefield, the Soldier will enter as a 0/0 creature, but then Ancestral Blade will make it a 1/1 and the token will survive."}],"setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"a41f4fb4-4edc-5ec3-9a2a-62b7235b4acc"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":["Equipment"],"supertypes":[],"text":"When this Equipment enters, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token, then attach this Equipment to it.\nEquipped creature gets +1/+1.\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)","type":"Artifact — Equipment","types":["Artifact"],"uuid":"5a34c3f9-3633-5770-990f-409dfbc1aaf6"},{"artist":"Jeremy Enecio","artistIds":["f9e1fab6-f366-4dae-a5c7-736d475312b8"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["W"],"colors":["W"],"convertedManaCost":6.0,"edhrecRank":11728,"edhrecSaltiness":0.17,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"flavorText":"\"The dead have it easy. They suffer no more. If breaking their rest helps the living, so be it.\"\n—Olka, mistmeadow witch","foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"2003","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"303258","cardsphereId":"127947","deckboxId":"95614","mtgjsonV4Id":"f6dd4adc-c729-554f-8044-88608774eff6","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"5e1ae45c-ac55-468d-8e27-e72b5954ce94","scryfallIllustrationId":"589b5f85-297b-47cc-b700-d63ef36bafcf","scryfallOracleId":"376271a6-80f0-47a6-990a-5ec5517aae42","tcgplayerProductId":"582477"},"isReprint":true,"language":"English","layout":"normal","legalities":{"commander":"Legal","duel":"Legal","legacy":"Legal","modern":"Legal","oathbreaker":"Legal","predh":"Legal","vintage":"Legal"},"manaCost":"{2/W}{2/W}{2/W}","manaValue":6.0,"name":"Spectral Procession","number":"SHM-23","originalReleaseDate":"2024-08-02","printings":["C14","DDK","MD1","MM2","PLST","SHM"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/c0148e08539ca312","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/7c17f366ad4eb3c0"},"rarity":"uncommon","relatedCards":{"tokens":["4e0e7748-abc8-5a7b-ab2f-483c152fa372"]},"rulings":[{"date":"2008-05-01","text":"A card with a monocolored hybrid mana symbol in its mana cost is each of the colors that appears in its mana cost, regardless of what mana was spent to cast it. Thus, Spectral Procession is white even if you spend six blue mana to cast it."},{"date":"2008-05-01","text":"A card with monocolored hybrid mana symbols in its mana cost has a mana value equal to the highest possible cost it could be cast for. Its mana value never changes. Thus, Spectral Procession has a mana value of 6, even if you spend {W}{W}{W} to cast it."},{"date":"2008-05-01","text":"If a cost includes more than one monocolored hybrid mana symbol, you can choose a different way to pay for each symbol. For example, you can pay for Spectral Procession by spending {W}{W}{W}, {2}{W}{W}, {4}{W}, or {6}."},{"date":"2008-05-01","text":"If an effect reduces the cost to cast a spell by an amount of generic mana, it applies to a monocolored hybrid spell only if you've chosen a method of paying for it that includes generic mana."}],"setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"52798f7a-9f6e-5d68-bc4c-3d824deb97a4"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-