ess":"2","type":"Creature — Goblin","types":["Creature"],"uuid":"d6b9e22d-3346-5139-aecc-a3a87450d77d"},{"artist":"Pete Venters","artistIds":["d54c4a1a-c0c5-4834-84db-125d341f3ad8"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["B"],"colors":["B"],"convertedManaCost":4.0,"edhrecRank":24495,"edhrecSaltiness":0.0,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"1997","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"303805","cardsphereId":"128094","deckboxId":"96242","mcmId":"791812","mtgjsonV4Id":"e484f902-223a-52ef-8d66-adb6e9bdba02","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"7c9b45f8-15a3-4aba-9860-51bcebfcef3f","scryfallIllustrationId":"3d101bd3-799e-4659-a000-b3634aa1a5e2","scryfallOracleId":"414eb407-dd39-41d2-bf25-a7a77ff35cb4","tcgplayerProductId":"582649"},"isReprint":true,"language":"English","layout":"normal","leadershipSkills":{"brawl":false,"commander":false,"oathbreaker":false,"pauper_commander":true,"predh":false},"legalities":{"commander":"Legal","duel":"Legal","legacy":"Legal","oathbreaker":"Legal","predh":"Legal","premodern":"Legal","vintage":"Legal"},"manaCost":"{3}{B}","manaValue":4.0,"name":"Deepwood Legate","number":"MMQ-132","originalReleaseDate":"2024-08-02","power":"1","printings":["MMQ","PLST"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/36d6899da7d41783","cardmarket":"https://mtgjson.com/links/8f532b63413a7fd0","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/cd189626e0a993f1"},"rarity":"uncommon","setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"aa48601a-c9e4-504b-b09c-f3c8c46abc41"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":["Shade"],"supertypes":[],"text":"If an opponent controls a Forest and you control a Swamp, you may cast this spell without paying its mana cost.\n{B}: This creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.","toughness":"1","type":"Creature — Shade","types":["Creature"],"uuid":"c71e9f3d-1739-5f2b-8bd3-951bbc044e67"},{"artist":"Mark Tedin","artistIds":["9ee9a9cc-c09e-486f-918b-69f80cbc4188"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["G"],"colors":["G"],"convertedManaCost":7.0,"edhrecRank":23209,"edhrecSaltiness":0.07,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"flavorText":"Tall as a tree and probably related.","foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"1997","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"304346","cardsphereId":"128773","deckboxId":"96245","mtgjsonV4Id":"8645f92b-18cf-522f-b8bf-d0df3a314cff","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"85dc1ff4-c37f-46a1-b2a6-8586043f0eed","scryfallIllustrationId":"2d981010-79cb-4c0b-a659-740ced441f8e","scryfallOracleId":"61ade140-5b11-4882-82e5-a075fc80b260","tcgplayerProductId":"583332"},"isReprint":true,"keywords":["Cycling","Forestcycling","Landcycling","Typecycling"],"language":"English","layout":"normal","legalities":{"commander":"Legal","duel":"Legal","legacy":"Legal","oathbreaker":"Legal","pauper":"Legal","paupercommander":"Legal","penny":"Legal","predh":"Legal","premodern":"Legal","vintage":"Legal"},"manaCost":"{5}{G}{G}","manaValue":7.0,"name":"Wirewood Guardian","number":"SCG-132","originalReleaseDate":"2024-08-02","power":"6","printings":["PLST","SCG","TD0"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/dccb41f3aec09a1a","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/1d7b24cc0fd45267"},"rarity":"common","rulings":[{"date":"2009-02-01","text":"Forestcycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on Forestcycling this card. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops Forestcycling from being activated."},{"date":"2009-02-01","text":"Forestcycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with Forestcycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not."},{"date":"2009-02-01","text":"Unlike the normal cycling ability, Forestcycling doesn’t allow you to draw a card. Instead, it lets you search your library for a Forest card. After you find a Forest card in your library, you reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library."},{"date":"2009-02-01","text":"You can choose to find any card with the Forest land type, including nonbasic lands. You can also choose not to find a card, even if there is a Forest card in your library."}],"setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"1300fb2d-7d80-50cc-822e-3a77cc1a0e32"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":["Elf","Mutant"],"supertypes":[],"text":"Forestcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Forest card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)","toughness":"6","type":"Creature — Elf Mutant","types":["Creature"],"uuid":"b86cb016-6f99-5194-abd2-7101c813ecd9"},{"artist":"David Palumbo","artistIds":["04ce1c75-e30c-4b7a-8cb0-b53e4ecc2f39"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["R"],"colors":["R"],"convertedManaCost":3.0,"edhrecRank":14358,"edhrecSaltiness":0.0,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"flavorText":"In life, they revered a diverse pantheon of gods. Now they revere only the God-Pharaoh.","foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"2015","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"304149","cardsphereId":"128809","deckboxId":"96248","mcmId":"792207","mtgjsonV4Id":"fd12a618-e91a-59b7-a0fc-9f7add32b935","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"b30fd369-68db-41f1-bb1e-eabfe4eb5356","scryfallIllustrationId":"4109d0d5-c081-4dc0-bc7b-1315cf196d81","scryfallOracleId":"5ce7780d-8a32-44c2-b779-aae732f5b05d","tcgplayerProductId":"583368"},"isReprint":true,"keywords":["Amass"],"language":"English","layout":"normal","legalities":{"brawl":"Legal","commander":"Legal","competitivebrawl":"Legal","duel":"Legal","gladiator":"Legal","historic":"Legal","legacy":"Legal","modern":"Legal","oathbreaker":"Legal","pauper":"Legal","paupercommander":"Legal","penny":"Legal","pioneer":"Legal","timeless":"Legal","vintage":"Legal"},"manaCost":"{2}{R}","manaValue":3.0,"name":"Honor the God-Pharaoh","number":"WAR-132","originalReleaseDate":"2024-08-02","printings":["PLST","WAR"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/90b9c0bce4938009","cardmarket":"https://mtgjson.com/links/391ac3be5d1d4858","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/97f94fa7122c7171"},"rarity":"common","relatedCards":{"tokens":["984fef88-c3f0-5edb-bd4a-4dcccf2accb3"]},"rulings":[{"date":"2019-05-03","text":"You must discard exactly one card to cast Honor the God-Pharaoh; you can't cast it without discarding a card, and you can't discard additional cards."},{"date":"2023-06-16","text":"Amass Orcs works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token if you don't control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn't already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."},{"date":"2023-06-16","text":"Amass abilities are now written as \"amass [subtype] N.\" Previous cards with amass have received errata to say \"amass Zombies N.\""},{"date":"2023-06-16","text":"If you don't control an Army, the Zombie Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."},{"date":"2023-06-16","text":"In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Zombies, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn't a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types."},{"date":"2023-06-16","text":"Some cards refer to the \"amassed Army.\" That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason."},{"date":"2023-06-16","text":"To amass Zombies N, if you don't control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn't already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types."}],"setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"6006231c-8d54-59ef-b53e-2c1ade682038"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":[],"supertypes":[],"text":"As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard a card.\nDraw two cards. Amass Zombies 1. (Put a +1/+1 counter on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)","type":"Sorcery","types":["Sorcery"],"uuid":"9c1e6ecf-23bd-5162-aca0-4361a3b4b62e"},{"artist":"Raoul Vitale","artistIds":["c7c15d49-f84b-4d98-9a34-e80e8347b756"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["R"],"colors":["R"],"convertedManaCost":3.0,"edhrecRank":13874,"edhrecSaltiness":0.0,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"2015","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"304007","cardsphereId":"128635","deckboxId":"96250","mcmId":"791868","mtgjsonV4Id":"4d45b362-107e-5ac1-ac26-6e8cdd818600","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"89b6df62-af40-49f1-a66e-46cc85bc75d0","scryfallIllustrationId":"c860814a-883e-425f-b0f4-8ecd4b2dcef6","scryfallOracleId":"a6365f98-f652-492b-81de-5f8cd6fe0a1c","tcgplayerProductId":"583191"},"isReprint":true,"keywords":["Equip"],"language":"English","layout":"normal","legalities":{"brawl":"Legal","commander":"Legal","competitivebrawl":"Legal","duel":"Legal","gladiator":"Legal","historic":"Legal","legacy":"Legal","modern":"Legal","oathbreaker":"Legal","pauper":"Legal","paupercommander":"Legal","pioneer":"Legal","timeless":"Legal","vintage":"Legal"},"manaCost":"{2}{R}","manaValue":3.0,"name":"Dwarven Hammer","number":"KHM-133","originalReleaseDate":"2024-08-02","printings":["CMM","KHM","PLST"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/7f79151d02960cd8","cardmarket":"https://mtgjson.com/links/9c5069ce7a468fcf","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/5ab233dfe026c97e"},"rarity":"uncommon","relatedCards":{"tokens":["58592a45-5fc9-5e4a-8134-4c88f4bf270a"]},"rulings":[{"date":"2021-02-05","text":"The Dwarf Berserker creature token enters the battlefield as a 2/1 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield will see the token enter as a 2/1 creature."},{"date":"2021-02-05","text":"You decide whether to pay {2} as the enters-the-battlefield ability resolves. If you do, you immediately create the Dwarf Berserker creature token and attach Dwarven Hammer to it. No players may respond to your decision to pay or not, and no player may take actions during this process."}],"setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"7ec206c3-6660-568d-a33b-22f11a0eeea6"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":["Equipment"],"supertypes":[],"text":"When this Equipment enters, you may pay {2}. If you do, create a 2/1 red Dwarf Berserker creature token, then attach this Equipment to it.\nEquipped creature gets +3/+0 and has trample.\nEquip {3}","type":"Artifact — Equipment","types":["Artifact"],"uuid":"a4662bcc-9b03-518d-b60d-5c20b8d043a6"},{"artist":"Matt Stewart","artistIds":["20871267-2d8a-41d5-b03a-be3d557c5734"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["B"],"colors":["B"],"convertedManaCost":1.0,"edhrecRank":25285,"edhrecSaltiness":0.29,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"2003","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"303851","cardsphereId":"128487","deckboxId":"96252","mtgjsonV4Id":"bc50a5b3-0cb8-50ce-a8bf-d2d4fb3a2408","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"d82f650d-9142-4042-ba5c-503c0f80b34e","scryfallIllustrationId":"809e6601-6b92-4571-98e3-faf3ccf3edd0","scryfallOracleId":"0ab5fde8-e7db-4265-81c6-2a6488ba56c4","tcgplayerProductId":"583043"},"isReprint":true,"keywords":["Level Up"],"language":"English","layout":"leveler","legalities":{"commander":"Legal","duel":"Legal","legacy":"Legal","modern":"Legal","oathbreaker":"Legal","pauper":"Legal","paupercommander":"Legal","penny":"Legal","predh":"Legal","vintage":"Legal"},"manaCost":"{B}","manaValue":1.0,"name":"Zulaport Enforcer","number":"ROE-133","originalReleaseDate":"2024-08-02","power":"1","printings":["PLST","ROE"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/0ca8f91d2034767c","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/7aa61b06aa75e25a"},"rarity":"common","rulings":[{"date":"2010-06-15","text":"A creature's level is based on how many level counters it has on it, not how many times its level up ability has been activated or has resolved. If a leveler gets level counters due to some other effect (such as Clockspinning) or loses level counters for some reason (such as Vampire Hexmage), its level is changed accordingly."},{"date":"2010-06-15","text":"Effects that modify a leveler's power or toughness, such as the effects of Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem, will apply to it no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature's power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness."},{"date":"2010-06-15","text":"Effects that set a leveler's power or toughness to a specific value, including the effects from a level symbol's ability, apply in timestamp order. The timestamp of each level symbol's ability is the same as the timestamp of the leveler itself, regardless of when the most recent level counter was put on it."},{"date":"2010-06-15","text":"If another creature becomes a copy of a leveler, all of the leveler's printed abilities — including those represented by level symbols — are copied. The current characteristics of the leveler, and the number of level counters on it, are not. The abilities, power, and toughness of the copy will be determined based on how many level counters are on the copy."},{"date":"2010-06-15","text":"The abilities a leveler grants to itself don't overwrite any other abilities it may have. In particular, they don't overwrite the creature's level up ability; it always has that."}],"setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"b6151319-9e8e-517a-b042-bbc8a466f0f6"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":["Human","Warrior"],"supertypes":[],"text":"Level up {4} ({4}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\nLEVEL 1-2\n3/3\nLEVEL 3+\n5/5\nThis creature can't be blocked except by black creatures.","toughness":"1","type":"Creature — Human Warrior","types":["Creature"],"uuid":"684525e8-5a13-5803-aab0-e6088ed5bf19"},{"artist":"Josu Hernaiz","artistIds":["74246024-92b4-43d0-a5af-a3f9f2a35d5f"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["R","W"],"colors":["R"],"convertedManaCost":3.0,"edhrecRank":26072,"edhrecSaltiness":0.0,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"2015","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"303969","cardsphereId":"128820","deckboxId":"96262","mcmId":"792305","mtgjsonV4Id":"ea8512dc-eb9a-5331-b575-17e6b42c47b5","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"fc9a1d19-dd3b-4a35-9430-88e2c855489e","scryfallIllustrationId":"5d0240d8-3b99-46b5-bee3-355994da6531","scryfallOracleId":"6465f93d-e6bf-4a7b-86f3-5a2376f8b127","tcgplayerProductId":"583379"},"isReprint":true,"keywords":["Kicker"],"language":"English","layout":"normal","legalities":{"brawl":"Legal","commander":"Legal","competitivebrawl":"Legal","duel":"Legal","gladiator":"Legal","historic":"Legal","legacy":"Legal","modern":"Legal","oathbreaker":"Legal","pauper":"Legal","paupercommander":"Legal","penny":"Legal","pioneer":"Legal","timeless":"Legal","vintage":"Legal"},"manaCost":"{2}{R}","manaValue":3.0,"name":"Keldon Strike Team","number":"DMU-136","originalReleaseDate":"2024-08-02","power":"3","printings":["DMU","PLST"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/fa5c0b10cf69d6f7","cardmarket":"https://mtgjson.com/links/e4729f054426b3dc","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/f9847cc70fb4a0a6"},"rarity":"common","relatedCards":{"tokens":["7448081c-7411-5fed-aafe-634b8ae05a30"]},"rulings":[{"date":"2022-09-09","text":"Creatures that enter the battlefield after Keldon Strike Team on the turn it entered the battlefield will have haste as long as it's still on the battlefield. Notably, this includes the Soldier creature tokens it creates if it was kicked."},{"date":"2022-09-09","text":"If Keldon Strike Team leaves the battlefield during combat during the turn it entered the battlefield, any attacking creatures that came under your control this turn will continue to attack, even if they no longer have haste."},{"date":"2022-09-09","text":"Keldon Strike Team's last ability grants itself haste in addition to any other creatures you control."},{"date":"2024-11-08","text":"If a card or token enters as a copy of a permanent, the new permanent isn't kicked, even if the original was."},{"date":"2024-11-08","text":"If a spell's kicker cost was paid, the spell is \"kicked.\""},{"date":"2024-11-08","text":"If you copy a kicked spell on the stack, the copy is also kicked. If the copied spell is a permanent spell, the token the copy of that spell becomes when it enters is also kicked."},{"date":"2024-11-08","text":"If you put a permanent with a kicker ability onto the battlefield without casting it, you can't kick it."},{"date":"2024-11-08","text":"The kicker ability doesn't let you pay a kicker cost more than once."},{"date":"2024-11-08","text":"To determine a spell's total cost, start with the mana cost (or an alternative cost if another card's effect allows you to pay one instead), add any cost increases (such as kicker), then apply any cost reductions. The spell's mana value remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}],"setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"ce05b5e4-7702-560a-b7ff-cdd032270e01"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":["Human","Warrior"],"supertypes":[],"text":"Kicker {1}{W} (You may pay an additional {1}{W} as you cast this spell.)\nWhen this creature enters, if it was kicked, create two 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens.\nAs long as this creature entered this turn, creatures you control have haste.","toughness":"1","type":"Creature — Human Warrior","types":["Creature"],"uuid":"70db34d9-f277-5fea-961d-65ef9e580293"},{"artist":"Ben Thompson","artistIds":["f3116c88-57f4-4fd1-95f3-cfd163977661"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["B","W"],"colors":["B","W"],"convertedManaCost":3.0,"edhrecRank":11105,"edhrecSaltiness":0.15,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"1997","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"304475","cardsphereId":"128313","deckboxId":"96269","mcmId":"791873","mtgjsonV4Id":"ef8f206c-9e05-5eca-9c95-b54668e6aed3","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"04597f03-5723-4ac7-84b0-8a7fa1716026","scryfallIllustrationId":"c51ae529-6d00-4335-8b48-df62aa85bfe7","scryfallOracleId":"71a7f695-06b9-461d-9646-ffb975b375fc","tcgplayerProductId":"582868"},"isReprint":true,"language":"English","layout":"normal","leadershipSkills":{"brawl":false,"commander":false,"oathbreaker":false,"pauper_commander":true,"predh":false},"legalities":{"commander":"Legal","duel":"Legal","legacy":"Legal","oathbreaker":"Legal","predh":"Legal","premodern":"Legal","vintage":"Legal"},"manaCost":"{1}{W}{B}","manaValue":3.0,"name":"Edgewalker","number":"SCG-137","originalReleaseDate":"2024-08-02","power":"2","printings":["PLST","SCG"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/68577093539132dd","cardmarket":"https://mtgjson.com/links/65770d6ab2f9106e","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/544bad53c00fa5e8"},"rarity":"uncommon","rulings":[{"date":"2004-10-04","text":"If you have more than one of these on the battlefield, the cost reduction is cumulative."},{"date":"2008-08-01","text":"If a spell has hybrid mana symbols in its mana cost, you choose which half you will be paying before determining the total cost. If you choose to pay such a cost with {W} or {B}, Edgewalker can reduce that part of the cost."},{"date":"2008-08-01","text":"You apply cost reduction effects after other cost modifiers, so it can reduce additional costs or alternative costs if they include {W} and/or {B}."}],"setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"add8ec57-c1ee-50ba-8052-8a3e9b7086b5"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":["Human","Cleric"],"supertypes":[],"text":"Cleric spells you cast cost {W}{B} less to cast. This effect reduces only the amount of colored mana you pay. (For example, if you cast a Cleric spell with mana cost {1}{W}, it costs {1} to cast.)","toughness":"2","type":"Creature — Human Cleric","types":["Creature"],"uuid":"dd96fa10-3561-5bfe-93e0-af403056ca3e"},{"artist":"Filip Burburan","artistIds":["66082c3b-a623-4d34-be51-2475214b85d3"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["G"],"colors":["G"],"convertedManaCost":4.0,"edhrecRank":24009,"edhrecSaltiness":0.27,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"2015","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"304223","cardsphereId":"128564","deckboxId":"96271","mcmId":"792559","mtgjsonV4Id":"6ae67ff9-5250-5958-984b-6c80294e1463","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"6c9273e1-7482-41c7-aa7