k","colorIdentity":[],"colors":[],"convertedManaCost":7.0,"edhrecRank":8913,"edhrecSaltiness":0.23,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"2015","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"304546","cardsphereId":"128553","deckboxId":"96353","mcmId":"792040","mtgjsonV4Id":"fd31db9e-6c1c-5305-b515-a6cc7a52125b","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"43006ff7-6240-4ee1-8ea0-2dc9ad869165","scryfallIllustrationId":"f6aefda5-3150-4623-aa9e-b31ecd8ec596","scryfallOracleId":"9f2d2fda-f098-4375-8fe9-63f929e3928c","tcgplayerProductId":"583109"},"isReprint":true,"language":"English","layout":"normal","legalities":{"brawl":"Legal","commander":"Legal","competitivebrawl":"Legal","duel":"Legal","gladiator":"Legal","historic":"Legal","legacy":"Legal","modern":"Legal","oathbreaker":"Legal","penny":"Legal","pioneer":"Legal","timeless":"Legal","vintage":"Legal"},"manaCost":"{7}","manaValue":7.0,"name":"God-Pharaoh's Gift","number":"HOU-161","originalReleaseDate":"2024-08-02","printings":["AKR","DRC","HOU","PHOU","PLST"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/fb362ad8c65327d5","cardmarket":"https://mtgjson.com/links/bbcc6f7ca7e848ef","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/cf35b62729c622ad"},"rarity":"rare","relatedCards":{"tokens":["0a417209-92ea-5ce3-ae2c-251ee22f1b92"]},"rulings":[{"date":"2017-07-14","text":"If the card copied by the token had any \"when [this permanent] enters the battlefield\" abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it's created. Similarly, any \"as [this permanent] enters the battlefield\" or \"[this permanent] enters the battlefield with\" abilities that the token has copied will also work."},{"date":"2017-07-14","text":"The ability of God-Pharaoh's Gift doesn't target the creature card you'll exile. You choose one as the ability resolves. No player may take actions between the time you choose a creature card to exile and the time you create the token."},{"date":"2017-07-14","text":"The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics it specifically modifies. It doesn't copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard."},{"date":"2017-07-14","text":"The token is a Zombie instead of its other types (unlike Zombies created by an eternalize ability) and is black instead of its other colors. Its power and toughness are 4/4. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy."},{"date":"2017-07-14","text":"Unlike the tokens created by an eternalize ability, this token has the mana cost and thus mana value of the card it's copying."}],"securityStamp":"oval","setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"c852eca6-b8b2-5f9e-8e92-aaf59e9b940f"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":[],"supertypes":[],"text":"At the beginning of combat on your turn, you may exile a creature card from your graveyard. If you do, create a token that's a copy of that card, except it's a 4/4 black Zombie. It gains haste until end of turn.","type":"Artifact","types":["Artifact"],"uuid":"24fa00f7-9fa2-5fcd-99ba-b5059a1ecdc0"},{"artist":"Thomas M. Baxa","artistIds":["ff346569-557d-4043-ae44-97c2c7cabd7d"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["R"],"colors":["R"],"convertedManaCost":1.0,"edhrecRank":16353,"edhrecSaltiness":0.29,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"flavorText":"Some time rifts didn't take away the people but just the ground they stood on.","foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"2003","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"304128","cardsphereId":"128802","deckboxId":"96360","mcmId":"792166","mtgjsonV4Id":"61ce877b-db46-51c6-beb9-120a46a40868","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"16452395-6cce-4c3c-ae56-8f70b9961f49","scryfallIllustrationId":"e6a9b3da-427e-4989-9e80-a286e8e8c656","scryfallOracleId":"c1f7d451-ca70-403d-81bf-8822876d1a54","tcgplayerProductId":"583361"},"isReprint":true,"keywords":["Storm"],"language":"English","layout":"normal","legalities":{"commander":"Legal","duel":"Legal","legacy":"Legal","modern":"Legal","oathbreaker":"Legal","pauper":"Legal","paupercommander":"Legal","penny":"Legal","predh":"Legal","vintage":"Legal"},"manaCost":"{R}","manaValue":1.0,"name":"Ground Rift","number":"TSP-162","originalReleaseDate":"2024-08-02","printings":["PLST","TSP"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/cabe0b84afee32b3","cardmarket":"https://mtgjson.com/links/7657c4696cec5dde","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/8b46e956ff633f95"},"rarity":"common","rulings":[{"date":"2022-12-08","text":"A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with storm won't affect the copies."},{"date":"2022-12-08","text":"Spells cast from zones other than a player's hand and spells that were countered are counted by the storm ability."},{"date":"2022-12-08","text":"The copies are put directly onto the stack. They aren't cast and won't be counted by other spells with storm cast later in the turn."},{"date":"2022-12-08","text":"The triggered ability that creates the copies can itself be countered by anything that can counter a triggered ability. If it is countered, no copies will be put onto the stack."},{"date":"2022-12-08","text":"You may choose new targets for any of the copies. You can make different choices for each copy."}],"setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"292eac0b-4a51-58eb-bb15-53dfadc3e54d"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":[],"supertypes":[],"text":"Target creature without flying can't block this turn.\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)","type":"Sorcery","types":["Sorcery"],"uuid":"0a9bde3c-4968-5e45-9ca2-1d23d2617dd5"},{"artist":"Jason A. Engle","artistIds":["02e2b5de-4341-464c-8fdb-a1adbf873bc0"],"availability":["paper"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["W"],"colors":["W"],"convertedManaCost":3.0,"edhrecRank":3340,"edhrecSaltiness":0.24,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"flavorText":"The Orzhov care not for repentance, only repayment.","foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"2015","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"303096","cardsphereId":"127903","deckboxId":"96361","mcmId":"792584","mtgjsonV4Id":"1f76a6a0-9e04-5677-853b-630d39f1b428","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"b94f2c12-a946-4eb2-aa9c-5034b4628680","scryfallIllustrationId":"08b08a92-644b-4cd0-8f87-6f7779bd8ea0","scryfallOracleId":"d5e9942e-096f-433f-8668-4b594f3c1b02","tcgplayerProductId":"582432"},"isReprint":true,"language":"English","layout":"normal","leadershipSkills":{"brawl":false,"commander":false,"oathbreaker":false,"pauper_commander":true,"predh":false},"legalities":{"commander":"Legal","duel":"Legal","legacy":"Legal","oathbreaker":"Legal","vintage":"Legal"},"manaCost":"{2}{W}","manaValue":3.0,"name":"Orzhov Advokist","number":"C16-3","originalReleaseDate":"2024-08-02","power":"1","printings":["C16","C21","CM2","CMR","MIC","MKC","NCC","PLST","PZ2"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/3c13ee794c3d5be7","cardmarket":"https://mtgjson.com/links/4ac93e0eabb73bb0","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/e3cc854fc5d70ae1"},"rarity":"uncommon","rulings":[{"date":"2020-11-10","text":"If a player chooses to accept Orzhov Advokist's gift, that player can't attack you or a planeswalker you control with any creatures during their next turn, even creatures that weren't on the battlefield as Orzhov Advokist's ability resolved."},{"date":"2020-11-10","text":"Orzhov Advokist's ability doesn't target the creatures that receive +1/+1 counters. Their controllers choose them as the ability resolves. Players can't take actions between making their choices and the +1/+1 counters being placed."},{"date":"2020-11-10","text":"Orzhov Advokist's effect keeps creatures from attacking you even if Orzhov Advokist leaves the battlefield, if the creature that received counters is no longer on the battlefield, or if an effect has moved those counters off of the creature that received them and put them onto another creature."},{"date":"2020-11-10","text":"While resolving Orzhov Advokist's ability, you choose a creature you control or choose not to put any counters on a creature, then each other player in turn order does the same. Each player will know the choices made by players who chose before them. Then simultaneously each player who chose a creature puts two +1/+1 counters on the creature they chose."}],"setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"25309a48-b0c9-5277-9735-04f9247a0ca2"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":["Human","Advisor"],"supertypes":[],"text":"At the beginning of your upkeep, each player may put two +1/+1 counters on a creature they control. If a player does, creatures that player controls can't attack you or planeswalkers you control until your next