ot necessarily even a creature."}],"setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"f1e886bb-83f4-5ef7-915b-4947b5509eb8"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":["Vedalken","Wizard"],"supertypes":[],"text":"When this creature enters, create a 1/1 green Squirrel creature token and a 0/3 blue Crab creature token.\nWhen this creature dies, create a token that's a copy of target token you control.","toughness":"1","type":"Creature — Vedalken Wizard","types":["Creature"],"uuid":"067a942e-3c4d-53a6-91b6-2c72847cb24f"},{"artist":"Wayne Reynolds","artistIds":["afc47cec-3ccc-404e-a8c6-4d83dd504271"],"availability":["paper"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["G"],"colors":["G"],"convertedManaCost":2.0,"edhrecRank":20289,"edhrecSaltiness":0.22,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"flavorText":"\"Don't mistake my creations for mere vegetation. They are my children, loyal and fierce.\"","foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"2003","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"304328","cardsphereId":"128370","deckboxId":"96590","mcmId":"791856","mtgjsonV4Id":"4d0a37f0-4ab5-58a7-bc6e-ad4e7d8ca650","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"6ef36eb5-b9a9-4c8d-92d4-847a8ed8933f","scryfallIllustrationId":"19dba8a7-732c-41b0-932a-bbbd542bea48","scryfallOracleId":"db2af2b0-a5aa-4e4a-b5bc-52a5ac3968fc","tcgplayerProductId":"582925"},"isReprint":true,"language":"English","layout":"normal","leadershipSkills":{"brawl":false,"commander":false,"oathbreaker":false,"pauper_commander":true,"predh":false},"legalities":{"commander":"Legal","duel":"Legal","legacy":"Legal","oathbreaker":"Legal","penny":"Legal","vintage":"Legal"},"manaCost":"{1}{G}","manaValue":2.0,"name":"Dreampod Druid","number":"PC2-64","originalReleaseDate":"2024-08-02","power":"2","printings":["PC2","PCA","PLST","VMA"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/bc31870f464c6770","cardmarket":"https://mtgjson.com/links/9e6c59e678d4d6bb","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/07546829221b8f5d"},"rarity":"uncommon","relatedCards":{"tokens":["dc6b409b-79e0-5103-9e78-2bf1c9a3deac"]},"rulings":[{"date":"2012-06-01","text":"Dreampod Druid’s ability checks to see if it’s enchanted at the beginning of each upkeep. If it’s not, the ability won’t trigger. If the ability triggers but Dreampod Druid isn’t enchanted when that ability resolves, the ability will do nothing."},{"date":"2012-06-01","text":"Notably, if Dreampod Druid leaves the battlefield while its ability is on the stack, that ability will use Dreampod Druid’s last known information to determine whether or not it was enchanted. If it was enchanted when it left the battlefield, the ability will resolve and create a Saproling."}],"setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"10c8d6ee-5a1c-5183-ad37-0dca12fcb60d"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":["Human","Druid"],"supertypes":[],"text":"At the beginning of each upkeep, if this creature is enchanted, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.","toughness":"2","type":"Creature — Human Druid","types":["Creature"],"uuid":"b0479a6b-f070-5bb4-aabc-71cefcb8975b"},{"artist":"Piotr Dura","artistIds":["aff176e8-1d15-432e-ad1d-207a474decba"],"availability":["paper"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["G","U"],"colors":[],"convertedManaCost":0.0,"edhrecRank":2799,"edhrecSaltiness":0.14,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"flavorText":"\"For a fortnight, our warband lay still beneath the icy waters, breathing through reeds as we waited for the great bear to appear.\"\n—Iskene, Kannah storyteller","foreignData":[],"frameEffects":["snow"],"frameVersion":"2015","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"277830","cardsphereId":"104846","deckboxId":"78946","mcmId":"714675","mtgjsonV4Id":"2e8cdc5e-977c-5328-a51b-fab038dfe67f","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"55db3506-8aca-4feb-960d-011d735963d1","scryfallIllustrationId":"8b03e682-944b-4725-b983-afe810aea0f7","scryfallOracleId":"983739cd-0b36-40d9-9a03-7b6aa7ffd0df","tcgplayerProductId":"496287"},"isReprint":true,"language":"English","layout":"normal","legalities":{"brawl":"Legal","commander":"Legal","competitivebrawl":"Legal","duel":"Legal","gladiator":"Legal","historic":"Legal","legacy":"Legal","modern":"Legal","oathbreaker":"Legal","pauper":"Legal","paupercommander":"Legal","pioneer":"Legal","timeless":"Legal","vintage":"Legal"},"manaValue":0.0,"name":"Rimewood Falls","number":"KHM-266","originalReleaseDate":"2023-05-08","printings":["KHM","PLST"],"producedMana":["G","U"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/194267c2cb05bc1f","cardmarket":"https://mtgjson.com/links/de792caa15fbb64c","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/aed3add97853095a"},"rarity":"common","rulings":[{"date":"2021-02-05","text":"Snow is a supertype, not a card type. It has no rules meaning or function by itself, but spells and abilities may refer to it."},{"date":"2021-02-05","text":"Snow isn't a type of mana. If an effect says you may spend mana as though it were any type, you can't pay for {S} using mana that wasn't produced by a snow source."},{"date":"2021-02-05","text":"Some cards have additional effects for each {S} spent to cast them. You can cast these spells even if you don't spend any snow mana to cast them; their additional effects simply won't do anything."},{"date":"2021-02-05","text":"The Kaldheim set doesn't have any cards with mana costs that include {S}, but some previous sets do. If an effect says such a spell costs {1} less to cast, that reduction doesn't apply to any {S} costs. This is also true for activated abilities that include {S} in their activation costs and effects that reduce those costs."},{"date":"2021-02-05","text":"The {S} symbol is a generic mana symbol. It represents a cost that can be paid by one mana that was produced by a snow source. That mana can be any color or colorless."}],"setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"0c445c6c-fdad-5c1e-8911-8b55f4338d85"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6","d2477e62-9bf9-5ed0-ba93-368e5843994f"]},"subtypes":["Forest","Island"],"supertypes":["Snow"],"text":"({T}: Add {G} or {U}.)\nThis land enters tapped.","type":"Snow Land — Forest Island","types":["Land"],"uuid":"8e502993-6acf-519e-bed6-5eaf927556c6"},{"artist":"Carl Critchlow","artistIds":["17948f16-611a-44b8-8d10-9895a0bdfff1"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["G"],"colors":["G"],"convertedManaCost":4.0,"edhrecRank":14045,"edhrecSaltiness":0.06,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"flavorText":"If the ground is smooth, the way will be rough.\n—Deepwood saying","foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"1997","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"304292","cardsphereId":"128703","deckboxId":"96597","mtgjsonV4Id":"4d7cfce2-b865-573f-a4ae-08caccbb8e11","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"baddb39b-c31f-48e4-8d43-1cc46a713416","scryfallIllustrationId":"a5f08941-2eb1-4d07-8597-03b0278e0aa7","scryfallOracleId":"115bd33d-4875-4014-ae9f-0052f5acdbb2","tcgp