If a spell or ability causes you to create a creature token and then instructs you to populate, you may choose to copy the token you just created, or you may choose to copy another creature token you control."},{"date":"2024-01-12","text":"The new creature token copies the characteristics of the original token as stated by the effect that created the original token."},{"date":"2024-01-12","text":"The new token doesn't copy whether the original token is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any noncopy effects that have changed its power, toughness, color, and so on."}],"securityStamp":"oval","setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"03892149-5556-5f87-a204-090a85639a60"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":["Human","Shaman"],"supertypes":["Legendary"],"text":"When Ghired enters, create a 4/4 green Rhino creature token with trample.\nWhenever Ghired attacks, populate. The token enters tapped and attacking. (To populate, create a token that's a copy of a creature token you control.)","toughness":"5","type":"Legendary Creature — Human Shaman","types":["Creature"],"uuid":"c1e98457-c8df-52bf-9dba-ffd0568ff6a2"},{"artist":"Cristi Balanescu","artistIds":["c09ede88-a1b5-4a18-9895-dc8a965d28a5"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["U"],"colors":["U"],"convertedManaCost":1.0,"edhrecRank":1984,"edhrecSaltiness":0.07,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"flavorText":"\"Any ship that sails on these mean seas for long is bound to pick up a ghost or two.\"\n—Admiral Beckett Brass","foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"2015","identifiers":{"ca