 otherwise consider the card to have been cast from your hand. The card was put onto the battlefield by the effect of Desertion instead."},{"date":"2024-04-12","text":"This spell includes a replacement effect. If the target is an artifact or creature spell, it never goes to the graveyard."}],"securityStamp":"oval","setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"2a36ca46-47e5-5177-8347-1a0858555477"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":[],"supertypes":[],"text":"Counter target spell. If an artifact or creature spell is countered this way, put that card onto the battlefield under your control instead of into its owner's graveyard.","type":"Instant","types":["Instant"],"uuid":"5131981b-80db-515b-a2b8-b28d6106e420"},{"artist":"Paul Scott Canavan","artistIds":["c19bfb77-5099-4f7c-8585-6eaf367712c9"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["W"],"colors":["W"],"convertedManaCost":2.0,"edhrecRank":10370,"edhrecSaltiness":0.19,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"flavorText":"\"The will to fight and act as one is not limited to a single world. Oketra's teachings are universal.\"\n—Basri Ket","foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"2015","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"303187","cardsphereId":"127754","deckboxId":"96699","mcmId":"791456","mtgjsonV4Id":"4f271512-8f84-5664-98a8-33ea48e8d6ad","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"f8ad702a-1e28-4673-a899-c16ed6b2a39c","scryfallIllustrationId":"acf87b4b-1593-4ab9-9545-6a1d9970489a","scryfallOracleId":"68281e06-64e3-490b-8691-8f4169614ec0","tcgplayerProductId":"581548"},"isReprint":true,"language":"English","layout":"normal","