e battlefield, those effects apply when checking to see if Mentor of the Meek's ability will trigger."},{"date":"2025-01-24","text":"Mentor of the Meek's ability checks the power of the other creature only as it enters. If that creature's power is 2 or less, the ability will trigger. Once the ability triggers, raising that creature's power above 2 won't affect that ability. Similarly, reducing the creature's power to 2 or less after it enters won't cause the ability to trigger."},{"date":"2025-01-24","text":"While resolving the triggered ability of Mentor of the Meek, you can't pay {1} multiple times to draw more than one card."}],"setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"85991863-9865-513b-8cf6-efbf46c661fe"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","15544ca5-b99f-5d37-9ff9-a34cb65d0946","1c6be48e-51ef-5604-bb56-3475fc49c820","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","5e5fe69e-56ee-55cc-a2b2-19f903a72aa6","60f39425-9415-5a4f-b331-dd7a18c5eedb","68c1eda6-e01b-594e-856b-1717fcd171cc","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","85b30c3e-1378-5143-8fc3-ad4d55faa19e","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","a87bfc00-197f-5474-b55a-e8342aaac80a","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6","c9b74555-134e-5865-b8f7-0d0cd26c8f58","ed686ac8-f381-5b34-9e58-db558bb57ef7","fe16600c-ad35-57c3-a56b-a9f321746b98"]},"subtypes":["Human","Soldier"],"supertypes":[],"text":"Whenever another creature you control with power 2 or less enters, you may pay {1}. If you do, draw a card.","toughness":"2","type":"Creature — Human Soldier","types":["Creature"],"uuid":"b7c72d80-8906-547c-ba6e-60f0a03675fc"},{"artist":"Jason Rainville","artistIds":["6ed7e669-579b-443d-b223-e5cbcb2a7483"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["W"],"colors":["W"],"convertedManaCost":1.0,"edhrecRank":1