:"Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, put a lore counter on this enchantment.\n{2}{W}: Put a lore counter on this enchantment.\n{W}: Until end of turn, this enchantment becomes a Monk Avatar creature in addition to its other types and gains \"This creature's power and toughness are each equal to the number of lore counters on it.\"","type":"Enchantment","types":["Enchantment"],"uuid":"c2a07b91-8c82-5479-9f6d-f96e01dee26d"},{"artist":"Steve Prescott","artistIds":["a1139fb8-41f5-4a9e-9a74-f662e1a23b35"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["B","R"],"colors":["B","R"],"convertedManaCost":4.0,"edhrecRank":1633,"edhrecSaltiness":0.28,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"foreignData":[],"frameEffects":["legendary"],"frameVersion":"2015","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"304469","cardsphereId":"128265","deckboxId":"96741","mcmId":"791565","mtgjsonV4Id":"5c3b5c2f-691c-5899-93ec-f1057170d5ff","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"91609595-a660-45bc-94ca-0df708f4e52c","scryfallIllustrationId":"f2696d1b-b176-4c50-a360-1d2ba93d84a1","scryfallOracleId":"14f6fcb0-bed4-4a38-b7df-1e438d81bedb","tcgplayerProductId":"582820"},"isReprint":true,"language":"English","layout":"normal","leadershipSkills":{"brawl":false,"commander":true,"oathbreaker":false,"pauper_commander":false,"predh":false},"legalities":{"brawl":"Legal","commander":"Legal","competitivebrawl":"Legal","duel":"Legal","gladiator":"Legal","historic":"Legal","legacy":"Legal","modern":"Legal","oathbreaker":"Legal","penny":"Legal","timeless":"Legal","vintage":"Legal"},"manaCost":"{2}{B}{R}","manaValue":4.0,"name":"Chainer, Nightmare Adept","number":"MH2-289","originalReleaseDate":"2024-08-02","power":"3","printings":["C19","J21","MH2","PLST"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/93d0e7549bab8e4d","cardmarket":"https://mtgjson.com/links/295a2510a631d0c1","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/61c5189c181b0f2f"},"rarity":"rare","rulings":[{"date":"2019-08-23","text":"Chainer's first ability doesn't change when you can cast the creature card. You can normally only cast it during your turn while the stack is empty, but if the creature card has flash, you can cast it at other times."},{"date":"2019-08-23","text":"Chainer's last ability triggers if Chainer enters the battlefield without being cast from your hand."},{"date":"2019-08-23","text":"Chainer's last ability triggers if the entering creature was cast from a zone other than your hand, or if it wasn't cast at all and is entering the battlefield from anywhere (including from your hand)."},{"date":"2019-08-23","text":"If you somehow activate Chainer's first ability more than once during a turn (perhaps because Chainer left the battlefield and returned), you can cast a creature card for each ability's permission. Similarly, if another effect allows you to cast a creature card from your graveyard, you may use that permission and later use Chainer's permission to cast another creature card."},{"date":"2019-08-23","text":"You don't choose a creature card to cast while activating or resolving Chainer's first ability. The ability creates a permission for you to cast a creature card from your graveyard later in the turn."}],"securityStamp":"oval","setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"31adf020-c3d5-5ae8-9e61-ee674e0e4b9f"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":["Human","Minion"],"supertypes":["Legendary"],"text":"Discard a card: You may cast a creature spell from your graveyard this turn. Activate only once each turn.\nWhenever a nontoken creature you control enters, if you didn't cast it from your hand, it gains haste until your next turn.","toughness":"2","type":"Legendary Creature — Human Minion","types":["Creature"],"uuid":"2f7ebfb5-fcbe-525c-9879-2af7bf5f86e3","watermark":"set"},{"artist":"Lucas Graciano","artistIds":["ce98f39c-7cdd-47e6-a520-6c50443bb4c2"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["R"],"colors":["R"],"convertedManaCost":3.0,"edhrecRank":21188,"edhrecSaltiness":0.2,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"2015","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"304042","cardsphereId":"128850","deckboxId":"96745","mcmId":"792672","mtgjsonV4Id":"a4e03d4e-620f-5637-ae39-a18965e92e7c","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"113f80ba-ccf3-46b9-84cc-58ec502bb114","scryfallIllustrationId":"a0cef463-8be0-4429-87d4-722ef71b7fec","scryfallOracleId":"a1e71473-3eba-4d29-87e2-7f14acab2ccd","tcgplayerProductId":"583409"},"isReprint":true,"keywords":["Bloodrush"],"language":"English","layout":"normal","leadershipSkills":{"brawl":false,"commander":false,"oathbreaker":false,"pauper_commander":true,"predh":false},"legalities":{"commander":"Legal","duel":"Legal","legacy":"Legal","modern":"Legal","oathbreaker":"Legal","penny":"Legal","pioneer":"Legal","vintage":"Legal"},"manaCost":"{2}{R}","manaValue":3.0,"name":"Pyrewild Shaman","number":"MM3-106","originalReleaseDate":"2024-08-02","power":"3","printings":["2XM","CLU","DGM","MM3","PLST"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardKingdom":"https://mtgjson.com/links/a5208e9a81a3a19b","cardmarket":"https://mtgjson.com/links/ce780db9b0fc0252","tcgplayer":"https://mtgjson.com/links/a59afa273c8fb073"},"rarity":"uncommon","rulings":[{"date":"2020-08-07","text":"If creatures you control deal combat damage to more than one player at the same time (most likely because it's a multiplayer game), Pyrewild Shaman's ability will trigger once for each of those players. However, only the first such ability that you pay for will return Pyrewild Shaman to your hand. Even if it's put back into your graveyard before the other abilities resolve, it's considered a different Pyrewild Shaman than the one whose ability triggered."},{"date":"2020-08-07","text":"Pyrewild Shaman's last ability triggers only if it's in your graveyard when the creatures deal combat damage to a player. Notably, if Pyrewild Shaman is dealt lethal damage at the same time that a creature you control deals combat damage to a player, Pyrewild Shaman's ability won't trigger."}],"setCode":"PLST","skuIds":{"nonfoil":"af9045bb-4bb8-535a-99ba-0599dafe3f9b"},"sourceProducts":{"nonfoil":["079afeee-9345-5b19-b902-d8d1725bfa45","1db93605-0a4e-5e5b-80a2-18a6e177f51d","3ccdf5f7-6548-57af-9e1c-a639100d1925","4cd5a7ce-3fb8-5780-a618-78d39c097a15","4f08144d-2ac5-5f6a-8606-7e05a3a27e02","84faf770-a5ed-51c1-922c-71ae2146ebed","90ce6f46-5779-57ee-9dc4-e293d6bc905f","abb45f16-c1bb-551f-8541-423e4508d55a","c5b42d17-7483-56a5-8676-d5cf70fef1a6"]},"subtypes":["Goblin","Shaman"],"supertypes":[],"text":"Bloodrush — {1}{R}, Discard this card: Target attacking creature gets +3/+1 until end of turn.\nWhenever one or more creatures you control deal combat damage to a player, if this card is in your graveyard, you may pay {3}. If you do, return this card to your hand.","toughness":"1","type":"Creature — Goblin Shaman","types":["Creature"],"uuid":"09ce9715-cec4-516a-9785-dccaa73b0056"},{"artist":"Scott M. Fischer","artistIds":["23b0cf43-3e43-44c6-8329-96446eca5bce"],"availability":["paper"],"boosterTypes":["default"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["B"],"colors":["B"],"convertedManaCost":5.0,"edhrecRank":9563,"edhrecSaltiness":0.33,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"1997","identifiers":{"cardKingdomId":"303680","cardsphereId":"128196","deckboxId":"96751","mcmId":"792537","mtgjsonV4Id":"781fa1f9-d508-5209-bf66-e0b49a36705b","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"36cdd278-7846-40e1-87df-c16e58786d3a","scryfallIllustrationId":"473799fc-